colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>BidirIt</code> must meet the requirements of <em class=\"t-named-req\">LegacySwappable</em>.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-full\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_swappable\"><span class=\"kw580\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_swappable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>BidirIt<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></span></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;regex&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Quick red cat\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/sub_match\"><span class=\"kw2019\">std::<span class=\"me2\">sub_match</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> x, y<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    x.<span class=\"me1\">first</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>s<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    x.<span class=\"me1\">second</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>s<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    x.<span class=\"me1\">matched</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    y.<span class=\"me1\">first</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>s<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu8\">012</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    y.<span class=\"me1\">second</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>s<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">13</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    y.<span class=\"me1\">matched</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Before swap:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"x.str() = [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"y.str() = [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>x.<span class=\"me1\">matched</span> and y.<span class=\"me1\">matched</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    x.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"After swap:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"x.str() = [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"y.str() = [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x.<span class=\"me1\">matched</span> and <span class=\"sy3\">!</span>y.<span class=\"me1\">matched</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Before swap:\nx.str() = []\ny.str() = [cat]\nAfter swap:\nx.str() = [cat]\ny.str() = []</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3204\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3204</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++11\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/sub_match\">std::sub_match</a></span> used inherited <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">pair</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>pair<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code><br>which led to a slicing\n</td>\n<td><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sub_match</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>sub_match<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is added\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/sub_match","title":"std::sub_match"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::sub_match<BidirIt>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Exchanges the contents of two sub-match objects. Equivalent to"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"s"},{"label":"Exceptions"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":189,"codeBlockCount":2}
